### Add admin authentification
POST http://localhost:8080/user/admin
content-type:application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

{
  "login": "111",
  "name": "111",
  "password": "111",
  "userType": "ADMIN"
}

### authentification by admin
POST http://localhost:8080/user/admin
content-type:application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

{
  "login": "Kirill",
  "name": "Kirill",
  "password": "123",
  "userType": "ADMIN"
}



