### Сreate pathNew admin
POST localhost:8080/fileSystem/create?path=1/cat&dir=newdir
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Get path exists direcory
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem/exists?path=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Delete path direcory
DELETE localhost:8080/fileSystem/delete?path=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Rename path direcory
PUT localhost:8080/fileSystem/rename?path=1/cat&newName=dog
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Loading path direcory
POST localhost:8080/fileSystem/loading?path=1/cat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png"

### Loading path direcory
POST localhost:8080/fileSystem/loadingList?path=1/cat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png", filename="1.png"



### Get Download file path direcory
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem/downloadFile?filePath=1/cat/2.png
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}


### Get Download file path direcory (на клиент)
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem/downloadFile?filePath=1/cat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Get Download file path zip direcory (на клиент)
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem/fileZip?filePath=1/cat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}



### Get Information file/path direcory
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem/informationDirName?dirName=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Get list files
GET localhost:8080/fileSystem
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Get list users
GET localhost:8080/user/listUsers
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}



